            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, emotion, enchantment, incapacitation, occult)\n\nThe swarm emits a distracting, cacophonous buzzing. Each creature within 20 feet must attempt a 26 Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected and temporarily immune for 1 minute.\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature is confused for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is confused for 1d4 rounds."
